## 5. Correctness Invariants (Unit Test Properties)

- **`Property 1` (Valid Execution):** For all valid inputs matching schema, the handler returns expected state and persists cleanly (`Req 1.1, 1.2`).
- **`Property 2` (Boundary Rejection):** For all invalid or unauthorized inputs, zero DB writes occur and structured errors return (`Req 1.3, 2.2`).
